The PatchTST files in pmse/backbones are derived from the supervised implementation of
PatchTST (yuqinie98/PatchTST), distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Upstream URLs, file hashes and local import changes are recorded in
third_party/provenance.json. Its license is preserved in third_party/PatchTST-LICENSE.
Original notices in the vendored files are retained.

TCN, iTransformer and DLinear and their necessary dependency definitions were
copied from PROCEED / OnlineTSF (SJTU-DMTai/OnlineTSF), whose pyproject.toml
declares Apache-2.0. Original and packaged file hashes, extracted definitions
and changes are recorded in third_party/OnlineTSF-provenance.json.
The TS2Vec and iTransformer MIT notices and LTSF-Linear Apache-2.0 notice are
retained in third_party/TS2Vec-LICENSE, iTransformer-LICENSE and
LTSF-Linear-LICENSE respectively.

The baseline implementation under vendor/onlinetsf, including the PROCEED
adapter, experiment framework, FSNet/OneNet models and ER/DERpp replay buffer,
is derived from SJTU-DMTai/OnlineTSF and the audited research server checkout.
Original file headers are retained. Source and integration changes are recorded
in docs/source_manifest.json and README.md. Official scripts are
preserved as configuration evidence under docs/recipes_source, not as the runner.
This project is an independent PMSE benchmark, not an official upstream release.

Dataset files have separate terms and are intentionally excluded from Git.
